a6ed-44b6-5aff-b569-b654686bca4d" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292068 1145 "Trigonometric functions are continuous at all points in their respective domains.\n\nThe function $\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x$ is continuous over the entire interval $[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{2}],$ but the function $\\operatorname{cot}⁡x$ is not defined at $x=\\pi .$ \n\nTherefore, the domain of $f(x)$ consists of the union of the intervals $[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pi ),$ and $(\\pi ,\\frac{3\\pi }{2}],$ namely\n\n$$\n[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pi )\\cup (\\pi ,\\frac{3\\pi }{2}]\n$$\n\nand the function is also continuous on this union of intervals." 13194139534499 true] [17592186292069 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292070 13194139534499 true] [17592186292069 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534499 true] [17592186292069 1041 "field-1" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292069 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292070 13194139534499 true] [17592186292069 1110 #uuid "89e9ea8e-b4d8-520b-8367-50b4da5e8125" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292070 1034 "\\pi" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292070 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534499 true] [17592186292070 1111 #uuid "71290c29-b822-55ca-b003-1b116fe3f6cc" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292071 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292072 13194139534499 true] [17592186292071 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534499 true] [17592186292071 1041 "field-2" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292071 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292072 13194139534499 true] [17592186292071 1110 #uuid "82caa028-7582-5f0d-b6e3-15d04b7cf487" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292072 1034 "\\pi" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292072 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534499 true] [17592186292072 1111 #uuid "3d0136a6-fdd2-51b7-9343-f689089153fe" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292073 1000 #edb/ref 17592186292074 13194139534499 true] [17592186292073 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534499 true] [17592186292073 1041 "field-3" 13194139534499 true] [17592186292073 1104 #edb/ref 17592186292074 13194139534499 true] [17592186292073 1110 #uu